Programe
    -> declaration

Declaration 
    -> Variable_declaration
    -> Expression_Statement
    -> Block Statement
    -> If_Statement


Variable_declaration
     "int" "identifier" (= Expression);

Block Statement
      -> { (declaration) }
     
Expression_Statement
    → expression ;

If_Statement
    -> "if" "(expression)" "Statement" (else "(If_Statement | blockStatement)")

While_Statement
    -> "while" "(expression)" "blockStatement"

Return_Statement
    -> "return" (expression)? ;

Function_Statement
    -> "int" "identifier" "((int identifer),*) "blockStatement"

Expression 
    -> Assignment

Assignment
    → BitwiseOr ("=" Assignment )

LogicalOR
    -> LogicalAnd ("||" LogicalAnd)*

LogicalAnd
    -> NotEqual ("&&" NotEqual)*

NotEqual
    -> BitwiseOr ("!=" BitwiseOr)*

BitwiseOr
    → BitwiseXor ( "|" BitwiseXor )*

BitwiseXor
    → BitwiseAnd ( "^" BitwiseAnd )*

BitwiseAnd
    → Equality ( "&" Equality )*

Equality
    → Relational ( "==" Relational )*

Relational
    → Shift ( ("<" | "<=" | ">" | ">=") Shift )*

Shift
    → Additive ( ("<<" | ">>") Additive )*

Additive
    → Multiplicative ( ("+" | "-") Multiplicative )*

Multiplicative
    → Primary ( ("*" | "/" | "%") Primary )*

Primary
    → Number
    | char
    | bool
    | Identifier (parameters)
    | "(" Expression ")"
